          "docs": "Add Shipment for Return Order This endpoint allows the user to add a shipment for a specific return order belonging to a seller. Request Body tracking_url (string) - The URL for tracking the shipment. awb_number (string) - The Air Waybill (AWB) number for the shipment. awb_label (string) - The URL to the AWB label for the shipment. package_details (object) - Details of the package including number of boxes, weight, dimensions, and remarks. number_of_boxes (integer) - The number of boxes in the s"
